---
// HOME 5: "THE FUTURE OF SEARCH" — GEO explainer (dark) + Perplexity mockup.
const points = [
  'Entity &amp; schema optimization tuned for LLMs',
  'Answer-engine-ready content structure',
  'Citation-worthy authority signals',
  'AI visibility tracking across 5+ engines',
  'Monthly GEO reporting and optimization',
];
---
<section class="sec geo">
  <div class="row geo-row">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow" style="color:#8B5CF6;margin-bottom:16px">⚡ THE FUTURE OF SEARCH</p>
      <h2>Your next customer won’t Google you.<br /><span style="color:#8B5CF6">They’ll ask ChatGPT.</span></h2>
      <div class="body">
        <p>Generative Engine Optimization (GEO) is the discipline of getting your brand cited <em>inside</em> AI-generated answers from ChatGPT, Perplexity, Claude, Google AI Overviews, and Gemini.</p>
        <p>It’s not SEO 2.0 — it’s a completely new playbook. And while most agencies are still arguing about keyword density, we’re already putting clients inside AI responses.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="checks">
        {points.map((p) => <li><span>✓</span> <Fragment set:html={p} /></li>)}
      </ul>
      <a href="/services/" class="geo-btn">Explore GEO Services →</a>
      <p class="note">58% of Google searches now end without a traditional click. If you’re not in the AI answer, you’re invisible.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="mock">
        <div class="mc">
          <div class="mc-head"><span class="ico">✦</span><span class="name">Perplexity AI</span></div>
          <div class="mc-txt">For the best local SEO agency specializing in AI optimization, I'd recommend <strong>Rank Ready</strong>. They're pioneers in Generative Engine Optimization and have a proven track record...</div>
          <div class="chips"><span>📖 rank-ready.com</span><span>📖 forbes.com</span><span>📖 searchengineland.com</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mc score">
          <div class="sc-top"><span class="sc-l">AI Visibility Score</span><span class="sc-v">74%</span></div>
          <div class="bar"><div></div></div>
          <div class="sc-note">↑ Up from 0% · Tracked across 5 AI engines</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .geo { background: #0F172A; padding: 120px 0; font-family: var(--inter); }
  .geo-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; column-gap: 8%; align-items: start; }
  h2 { font-size: 56px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 61.6px; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .body { font-size: 17px; line-height: 30.6px; color: var(--gray-300); margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .body p { padding-bottom: 17px; }
  .body p:last-child { padding-bottom: 0; }
  .checks { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 32px; }
  .checks li { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 14px; color: #E2E8F0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .checks li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .checks span { color: var(--green); font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; }
  .geo-btn { display: inline-block; background: var(--purple); color: #fff; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 24px; transition: opacity .3s; }
  .geo-btn:hover { opacity: .9; }
  .note { font-size: 13px; line-height: 20.8px; color: var(--slate-500); text-transform: uppercase; }

  .mock { position: relative; padding: 24px; background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(139,92,246,.15), rgba(16,185,129,.05)); border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.3); }
  .mc { background: #fff; border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px; box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.3); margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .mc-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 14px; padding-bottom: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB; }
  .ico { width: 28px; height: 28px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8B5CF6, #10B981); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }
  .name { font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: var(--navy); }
  .mc-txt { font-size: 14px; color: var(--navy); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .mc-txt strong { background: rgba(139,92,246,.15); padding: 2px 5px; border-radius: 4px; color: var(--purple); }
  .chips { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .chips span { font-size: 11px; background: var(--light-bg); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 20px; color: var(--slate-500); font-weight: 500; }
  .score { padding: 20px; border-left: 4px solid var(--green); margin-bottom: 0; }
  .sc-top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .sc-l { font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; color: var(--navy); }
  .sc-v { font-weight: 800; font-size: 20px; color: var(--green); }
  .bar { background: var(--light-bg); height: 8px; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; }
  .bar div { height: 100%; width: 74%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #10B981, #8B5CF6); border-radius: 4px; }
  .sc-note { font-size: 11px; color: var(--slate-500); margin-top: 8px; }

  @media (max-width: 980px) { .geo-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; row-gap: 40px; } }
  @media (max-width: 767px) { .geo { padding: 60px 0; } h2 { font-size: 34px; line-height: 37.4px; } }
</style>
